# Local-only artefacts: this repo is the public product facade, so evidence
# drops, mockups, planning drafts and throwaway DB probes stay untracked.
# The acceptance checklist's proof paths are relative to docs/, which is why
# these are ignored in place rather than moved out of the tree.
.qoder/
docs/*.html
docs/*.md
docs/shot-audio-*/
docs/shots-*/
LAN-ACCESS.md
PLAN_v*.md
RESEARCH.md
packages/db/probe_*.cjs
packages/db/mint_session_*.cjs
packages/db/shot-audio-session.cjs

# Agent tooling local config (same category as .qoder/ above)
.zcodeignore
